---
import { craft } from '../../data/craft';
---

<section class="craft-evolution" aria-labelledby="craft-evolution-title">
  <h2 id="craft-evolution-title">From an internal foundation to Craft</h2>
  <p>The MVP was handed to PropVR’s team as a foundation to extend. The current team developed, productionized, and expanded it into Craft.</p>
  <p>Craft’s tools index now lists <strong>{craft.tools} production tools live across six studios</strong>: {craft.studios.slice(0, -1).join(', ')}, and {craft.studios.at(-1)}. Direct tools can be used individually. Agentic 1.0 and Arc 1.0 are in early access, adding outcome planning and shared project context around those tools.</p>
  <p>That is the current PropVR Technology team’s platform. It should not be read as a retroactive description of the MVP I built.</p>
  <ol class="craft-evolution__steps" aria-label="Product evolution">
    <li><strong>Initial MVP</strong><span>22 tools across five studios</span><small>Pranshul Chandhok</small></li>
    <li><strong>Team handoff</strong><span>Product and technical foundation</span><small>PropVR Technology team takes it forward</small></li>
    <li><strong>Current Craft</strong><span>{craft.tools} production tools</span><small>{craft.directToolsStatus}</small></li>
    <li><strong>{craft.earlyAccess.join(' + ')}</strong><span>{craft.earlyAccessStatus}</span><small>Outcome planning and project context</small></li>
  </ol>

  <div class="craft-evolution__table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Initial MVP and current Craft comparison">
    <table>
      <caption>Product scope, then and now</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Initial PropVR AI MVP</th><th scope="col">Current Craft platform</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>22 tools across five workflow studios</td><td>{craft.tools} production tools live across six studios</td></tr>
        <tr><td>User selects a specialist tool</td><td>Direct tools plus agent-planned workflows</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Client-side prototype state</td><td>Shared project context through Arc in early access</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Proved workflow structure, tool boundaries, and model routing</td><td>Adds production operations, approval, consistency, and cost controls</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="craft-evolution__note">Availability checked: <time datetime={craft.checkedAt}>3 September 2026</time>.</p>
  <ul class="craft-evolution__sources" aria-label="Current Craft sources">
    {craft.sources.map((source) => <li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{source.label}<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>)}
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .craft-evolution { margin-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .craft-evolution h2 { max-width: 25ch; }
  .craft-evolution__steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-block: 2rem 3rem; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .craft-evolution__steps li { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .craft-evolution__steps li:last-child { border-inline-end: 0; }
  .craft-evolution__steps strong, .craft-evolution__steps span, .craft-evolution__steps small { display: block; }
  .craft-evolution__steps strong { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .craft-evolution__steps small { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .craft-evolution__table { overflow-x: auto; margin-block: 2rem; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; }
  caption { text-align: left; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  th, td { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: var(--inverse-surface); color: var(--inverse-text); }
  .craft-evolution__note { font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .craft-evolution__sources { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem 1.25rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .craft-evolution__steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .craft-evolution__steps li { border-inline-end: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } .craft-evolution__steps li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; } }
</style>
